# --- Gated SAE ---
# Separate gating (binary, which features fire) and magnitude (how much) paths,
# tied via W_enc with an independent r_mag scale. Sparsity comes from an L1
# penalty on the ReLU'd gating pre-activation (scaled by decoder norms), plus
# an auxiliary reconstruction-via-gate-path loss. Architecturally distinct
# from both hard-TopK (fixed k) and JumpReLU (learned per-feature threshold,
# ceiling ~0.70 per EXP-001..010) — untried method family per LEARNINGS.md.

